 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+An order takes at most one discount code, set with `applyCode(orderNumber, code)` (a second code replaces the first):
+
+- `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items, rounded to the nearest cent (a half cent rounds up);
+- `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off the items, only on an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more.
+
+An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error and the order is left as it was. The
+discount never touches shipping, and free shipping is decided on the items before any discount. `totals` shows
+`discountCents` (0 without a code); `totalCents` is items minus discount plus shipping.
