+# Discount codes on orders
+
+Spring campaign: customers get discount codes in the newsletter, so an order must be able to take one.
+
+- `SPRING10`: 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent (half a cent rounds up).
+- `WELCOME5`: 5.00 € off the items, only when the items come to 30.00 € or more.
+- One code per order at most; a second code replaces the first.
+- An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused with an error saying why; the order is unchanged.
+- The discount never touches shipping; free shipping is still decided on the items before any discount.
+- API: `OrderBook.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; `OrderTotals` gains `discountCents` (0 without a code);
+  `totalCents` = items - discount + shipping.
